## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
  input b content boolean
  input x content integer
  output o content integer

scope A:
  definition o equals 12
  exception definition o under condition b consequence equals x
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala DCalc -s A
let scope A (A_in: A_in): A =
  let get b : bool = A_in.b_in in
  let get x : integer = A_in.x_in in
  let set o : integer =
    error_empty
      ⟨ ⟨ ⟨b ⊢ ⟨x⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩ | true ⊢ ⟨ ⟨true ⊢ ⟨12⟩⟩ | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩ ⟩
  in
  return { A o = o; }
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala Concolic --conc-optim=incremental -s A
┌─[RESULT]─ Concolic execution ─
│ Executed 2 tests:
│       Inputs │ Outputs
│ ──────── Test #1 ─────
│ b_in = true  │ o = 0
│ x_in = 0     │
│ ──────── Test #2 ─────
│ b_in = false │ o = 12
│ x_in = 0     │
└─
```

